sequenceDiagram
  participant Source as Sysmon/Zeek/Suricata/Windows/Linux
  participant Adapter as Telemetry Adapter
  participant Contract as Schema Validator
  participant Stream as Redpanda/Kafka REST
  participant Worker as Stream Worker
  participant DB as telemetry_events
  Source->>Adapter: raw telemetry samples/logs
  Adapter->>Contract: normalized telemetry JSONL
  Contract-->>Adapter: valid/invalid result
  Adapter->>Stream: async event publish
  Stream->>Worker: partitioned consumption
  Worker->>DB: idempotent insert by event_id
